{"id": "225312", "name": "תוחלת מותנית – U אחיד סביב X מעריכי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathsf{Exp}({{CT:0}})\\)</span>.</p><p>נגדיר משתנה מקרי חדש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\)</span> באופן הבא: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((U|X=x)\\sim\\mathsf{U}[x-1,x+1]\\)</span> לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x&gt;0\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[U]\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחשבים את התוחלת המותנית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[U|X]\\)</span> ומשתמשים בנוסחת התוחלת השלמה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — התוחלת המותנית</b><br>התוחלת של התפלגות אחידה על קטע היא אמצע הקטע, ולכן לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x>0\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[U|X=x]=\\frac{(x-1)+(x+1)}{2}=x \\]</p>כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[U|X]=X\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — נוסחת התוחלת השלמה</b><br>לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[U]=\\mathbb{E}\\big[\\mathbb{E}[U|X]\\big]\\)</span> והתוחלת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathsf{Exp}(\\lambda)\\)</span>, שהיא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac1\\lambda\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[U]=\\mathbb{E}[X]=\\frac{1}{ {{CT:0}} } \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["la", "ta"], "nvariants": 9}